# The architect's drawing. Ours to work from, not ours to publish — and this repo and its
# GitHub Pages deploy are both public. Kept on the working machine only; the floorplan
# panel's underlay toggle disables itself when the file is not there. Every dimension
# derived from it already lives as plain numbers in src/floorplan.js, so nothing in the
# model depends on this file being present.
